# ============================================
# Backup Files
# ============================================
*_backup.*
*.backup
*.bak
*.old
*.orig

# ============================================
# Temporary Files & Folders
# ============================================
*.tmp
*.temp
tmp/
temp/

# ============================================
# Documentation Files
# Exclude all .md files except README.md
# ============================================
*.md
# Keep all README.md files throughout the project (root and subdirectories)
!README.md
!**/README.md

